{"slug":"Leetcode-172-Factorial-Trailing-Zeroes","title":"Leetcode#172. Factorial Trailing Zeroes","date":"2023-09-07","updated":"","tags":["Leetcode","Python","medium","💡","Math"],"categories":["Leetcode"],"cover":"/img/cover/leetcode.jpg","excerpt":"Given an integer , return the number of trailing zeroes in . Note that . Example 1: Example 2: Example 3: Constraints: - Follow up: Could you write a solution that works in logarithmic time complexity","sticky":0,"contentHtml":"<h1 id=\"problem\"><a href=\"#problem\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Problem</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<p>Given an integer <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>n</span></span></code></span>, return <em>the number of trailing zeroes in</em> <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>n!</span></span></code></span>.</p>\n<p>Note that <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>n! = n * (n - 1) * (n - 2) * ... * 3 * 2 * 1</span></span></code></span>.</p>\n<p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: n = 3</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Explanation: 3! = 6, no trailing zero.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Example 2:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: n = 5</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Explanation: 5! = 120, one trailing zero.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Example 3:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: n = 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>0 &#x3C;= n &#x3C;= 10^4</span></span></code></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Follow up:</strong> Could you write a solution that works in logarithmic time complexity?</p>\n<h1 id=\"solve\"><a href=\"#solve\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Solve</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<p>這題先搞懂 *trailing zeroes，*是指尾巴的0</p>\n<p>要計算尾巴有幾個0很簡單就是算其中乘了幾次(5*2)</p>\n<p>由於每次乘到5前，一定有2，所以找5有幾個就好</p>\n<h3 id=\"法1\"><a href=\"#法1\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>法1</span></span></code></span></a></h3>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">class</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\"> Solution</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> trailingZeroes</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B;font-style:italic\">self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">n</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        output </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, n </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            while</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">%</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                output </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                i </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">//=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 5</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> output</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Time Complexity : O(n)</p>\n<p><strong>當然這題不需要這麼麻煩</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"法2-用數學的方式\"><a href=\"#法2-用數學的方式\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>法2</span></span></code></span> 用數學的方式</a></h3>\n<p>其實這題數學的思考方法沒這麼麻煩，直接計算幾個5就好</p>\n<p>只需要注意當超過5的指數項，會增多</p>\n<p>所以也不用O(n)</p>\n<p>ex:</p>\n<p>n = 10 2個5</p>\n<p>n = 25 6個5</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">class</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\"> Solution</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> trailingZeroes</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B;font-style:italic\">self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">n</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        output </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        while</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">5</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">            output </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">//</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">5</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">            n </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">//</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">5</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> output</span></span></code></pre></figure>"}